2025-12-01 09:48:27,490 - benchmark.results_formatter - INFO -       Tool Appropriateness:
2025-12-01 09:48:27,490 - benchmark.results_formatter - INFO -         The agent used National Parks:findParks to list parks, getEvents for event schedules, getAlerts for operational notices, getParkDetails for park specifics, and Weather Data:get_weather_forecast_tool (plus search_locations_tool) for weather forecasts—each exactly matching the subtasks. Tool choices were optimal for each need.
