  - Contributions: New metric and dataset targeting naturalness and interactivity evaluation.
  - Results: Achieves strong lip sync, visual quality, and natural interactivity; balances data cost and identity scalability.

- A Lyapunov-Based Small-Gain Theorem for Fixed-Time Stability (Tang, Krstic, Poveda)
  - Contribution: A Lyapunov-based small-gain methodology for fixed-time stability (FxTS) in interconnected systems.
