  - Authors: Zhizhou Zhong; Yicheng Ji; Zhe Kong; Yiying Liu; Jiarui Wang; Jiasun Feng; Lupeng Liu; Xiangyi Wang; Yanjia Li; Yuqing She; Ying Qin; Huan Li; Shuiyang Mao; Wei Liu; Wenhan Luo
  - Problem: Multi-person talking video generation is data-expensive and struggles to drive multiple identities with coherent interactivity.
  - Contributions:
    - Architecture: Extensible multi-stream Diffusion Transformer with identity-aware attention that iteratively processes identity–audio pairs, scaling to arbitrary identities.
    - Training: Learns multi-person speaking patterns from single-person videos; refines interactivity with a small number of real multi-person clips.
