- Computed tomography-based unsupervised clustering identifies clusters associated with progression free survival in clear cell renal cell carcinoma (PubMed: 41287074; DOI: 10.1186/s40644-025-00958-x; 2025-01-01). Authors: Park JH et al. Aim: Develop and validate a CT imaging–based unsupervised clustering model to stratify prognosis in ccRCC and identify imaging predictors of 5-year PFS. Importance: Radiologic phenotyping may enable noninvasive risk stratification and guide personalized follow-up.

